[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0447","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0812","title":"Compaq WL310 Orinoco Residential Gateway 默认 SNMP 团体字符串信息泄露漏洞","description":"Compaq WL310 及以其为基础的 Orinoco Residential Gateway 接入点存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该设备使用系统标识字符串（system identification string）作为默认的 SNMP 读写团体字符串（read/write community string），且此默认值可预测、无需身份认证。远程攻击者只要能够访问目标设备的 SNMP 服务端口，通过 SNMP 查询该默认标识字符串即可读取并篡改设备敏感的配置信息，例如修改网络配置、管理员设置等，从而完全控制网关。该漏洞风险等级中等（CVSS 评分 6.4），利用难度较低，攻击条件仅为网络可达并对 161 端口进行 SNMP 探测，无需任何有效凭据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0812"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"建议立即修改受影响设备（Compaq WL310 及采用同一固件的 Orinoco  Residential Gateway）的 SNMP 默认读写团体字（community string），不要沿用出厂自带的系统标识字符串作为团体字，改为设置强随机口令并区分只读（read-only）与读写（read-write）权限。同时在其管理界面中禁用 SNMP 远程写入能力，若设备支持访问控制列表（ACL/VLAN）则将 SNMP 的 161/162 端口访问限制于可信任的内网管理网段，禁止对该端口暴露到互联网。若无法升级固件，应在防火墙上拦截外网对该设备 161/UDP 等 SNMP 端口的访问，作为临时缓解措施，防止被远程查询到系统标识并借此读取或篡改敏感配置信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0066.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0075.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9810.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5436","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21699","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0812","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a0a14ea0f3a80067c6bf2249ad236215b48e4418/2002/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0812.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0812.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0812.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0446","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0799","title":"YoungzSoft CMailServer 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"YoungZSoft CMailServer 3.30 及 4.0 版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长 USER 参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重，目前已公开利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0799"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:09Z","remediation":"立即升级 CMailServer 至 4.0.2003.06.01 及以上版本，该版本已修复 POP3 USER 命令缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，在防火墙上限制对 TCP 110 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并考虑迁移至现代邮件服务器（如 hMailServer 或 MailEnable）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/273512","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9132.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4789","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21467"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0445","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0793","title":"QNX RTOS 4.25 符号链接跟随任意文件修改漏洞","description":"QNX RTOS 4.25（QNX4）的多个系统工具存在硬链接与符号链接跟随漏洞。本地攻击者可通过 monitor 的 -f 参数、dumper 的 -d 参数、crttrap 的 -c 参数或 Watcom 示例工具，在低权限条件下利用符号链接攻击，以目标程序权限覆盖任意系统文件，导致本地权限提升或系统文件破坏。该漏洞影响 QNX4 全版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0793"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:08Z","remediation":"升级 QNX RTOS 至 4.25 之后的安全修复版本，或应用 QNX 官方提供的补丁。如无法升级，可移除 monitor、dumper、crttrap 等受影响工具的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/monitor /usr/bin/dumper /usr/bin/crttrap），并限制本地非授信用户登录系统以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0292.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9231.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4901","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4902","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4903","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4904","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9232","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9233","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9234","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21500","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0793","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2002/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0793.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0793.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0793.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0444","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0787","title":"Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 4.0 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 4.0 的 iCon 管理 Web 服务器存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向管理员 URL 中的 LOCID 或 OC 参数注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员访问特制链接时脚本将在管理员浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0787"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:08Z","remediation":"升级 Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 至厂商提供的最新补丁版本；如已无官方支持，应立即迁移至仍在维护的目录服务器产品。临时缓解措施：在 iCon 管理 Web 服务器中对 LOCID 和 OC 参数实施严格的输入验证与输出编码，禁止在管理 URL 中直接传递未过滤的用户输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0068.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9053.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4717","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21444","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0787","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2002/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0787.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0787.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0787.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0444.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0444.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0444.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0442","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0442.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0786","title":"Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 文件读取漏洞","description":"Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 4.0 的 iCon 管理 Web 服务器存在文件泄漏漏洞。已通过身份验证的 inJoin 管理员可通过向 LOG 参数中指定目标文件路径，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者需拥有有效管理员凭据方可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0786"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:07Z","remediation":"该产品（Critical Path InJoin Directory Server 4.0）已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的目录服务器产品（如 Microsoft Active Directory 或 OpenLDAP）。若无法立即迁移，应通过防火墙或反向代理严格限制 iCon 管理 Web 服务器的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 段访问管理端口，并禁用 LOG 参数中的路径遍历能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0068.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9054.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4718","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21445","https://github.com/CVEPro