updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:06Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Hosting Controller Service Pack 2（SP2），或下载官方补丁 drivebrowse.zip 并覆盖安装到网站根目录。如无法升级，可在 IIS 中移除或限制 /admin/browse.asp 的匿名访问权限，同时在 Web 应用层对 FilePath 参数进行路径合法性校验，禁止包含 \"..\" 或绝对路径的输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0168.html","http://hostingcontroller.com/english/logs/sp2log.html","http://www.hostingcontroller.com/english/patches/ForAll/download/drivebrowse.zip","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21464","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0775","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2002/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0775.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0775.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0775.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0437","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0773","title":"Hosting Controller 1.4 导入根目录命令执行漏洞","description":"Hosting Controller 1.4 的 imp_rootdir.asp 页面存在命令执行漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接向 imp_rootdir.asp 发送特制 HTTP 请求，修改 ftp、owwwPath、oftpPath 等参数，从而复制或删除服务器上的任意文件及目录。该漏洞影响 Hosting Controller 1.4 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低，可导致服务器完全受控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0773"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:06Z","remediation":"立即删除或重命名 imp_rootdir.asp 文件，或限制该文件的访问权限（如设置 NTFS 权限仅允许管理员访问）。升级到 Hosting Controller 最新版本（如 2.0 以上），并在 IIS 中配置 URL 授权规则，阻止对 imp_rootdir.asp 的匿名访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0142.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9105.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4761","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21457","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0773","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2002/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0773.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0773.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0773.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0437.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0437.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0435","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0772","title":"Hosting Controller DSNManager 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Hosting Controller 1.x 的 dsnmanager.asp 页面存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 RootName 参数提交包含 `..`（点点）的恶意路径，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件与目录。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露。受影响版本为 Hosting Controller 1.x，管理员应及时升级或限制 dsnmanager.asp 的访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0772"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Hosting Controller 至 2.0 或更高版本（该版本已修复 dsnmanager.asp 的路径遍历问题）。如无法升级，在 IIS 中移除或限制 dsnmanager.asp 的匿名访问权限，仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 /DSNManager/ 目录，同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面过滤包含 `../` 的 RootName 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0142.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9104.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21455","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0772","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e272b519ec8a57a1db338df26d96406/2002/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0772.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0772.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0772.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0433","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0433.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0771","title":"ViewCVS viewcvs.cgi 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"ViewCVS 0.9.2 的 viewcvs.cgi 页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 cvsroot 或 sortby 参数注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问特制链接时，脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，导致 Cookie 被窃取或页面内容被篡改。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接即可触发。该漏洞影响 ViewCVS 0.9.2 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0771"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:06Z","remediation":"升级 ViewCVS 至 0.9.2-5 或更高版本。如为 Debian 系统，执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install viewcvs`。同时对所有用户输入参数（尤其是 cvsroot 和 sortby）进行 HTML 实体编码输出，避免直接拼接至 HTML 页面。无法升级时，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面过滤包含 `<script>` 等危险标签的请求参数作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0161.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9112.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4818","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21473","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/C